ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Rebuild backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Built with the generic builder 2.9.0 from spec_v4_0_0: 03-materials/ch17/SEN0414_Ch17_PDFAndWordDocuments_3e_v4_0_0.pptx, 59 slides, 28 code examples; manifest chapter_code_ch17_v1_2_0.json (the builder adds a setup field, so the manifest is a new version and 1.1.0 stays unchanged). One more change found while checking and made: the layout check showed a note on slide 7 reaching 0.94 in past the slide's right edge (it was so in deck 3.0.0 too); visuals_v4_0_0.py limits its width. Builder WARN lines remain on ten examples (the result area is up to 0.17 in smaller than wanted), as in deck 3.0.0." .
ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress .
